---
// Game-day tie-in line, rendered inside index.astro's rail game tile only
// when gameSlot === 'jackrabbits' (an actual Jackrabbits sports game, not a
// general SDSU marquee event or a Moreno Valley regional game) -- see
// index.astro's gameSlot tie-break logic.
---

<a href="/play/" class="gameday-line">
  🐇 Feeling game-day energy? Play our Jackrabbit game
</a>

<style>
  /* Consistency pass (2026-09-10): was gold (#FFC629), the same one-off
     hex as JackrabbitWidget.astro's old gradient card -- see that file's
     comment. Uses the sitewide CTA accent instead. */
  .gameday-line {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--accent);
  }
  .gameday-line:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
